   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[9233]]></id>
    <qid><![CDATA[1020]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[<p>The WHO Regional Office for Europe (WHO/Europe) is considering developing a clinical network for the European Region and has asked EDCARN for the details of network members based in the Region.</p><p><strong>Do you agree that EDCARN may share your name, email address, organisation, specialization and country with the WHO Regional Office for Europe for this purpose?</strong></p>]]></question>
    <help><![CDATA[This is entirely your choice and does not affect your EDCARN membership. Your details will not be shared unless you select "Yes".]]></help>
    <script/>
    <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[9236]]></id>
    <qid><![CDATA[1021]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[We are sorry to see you go. If you are willing, please tell us why you would like to leave the network (optional):]]></question>
    <help/>
    <script/>
    <language><![CDATA[en]]></language>
